 "face": {
  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with the pupil, the blue-grey iris, the catchlights and a heavy upper lash line (the sleepy look) baked into the body atlas; the brows, blush, nose and the small \"w\" smile are baked into the body. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head, showing the closed lid sculpted and painted on the skin under it. The drizzle and the happy rainbow (#F28F8F #F7D36B #8FD1A8 #8FB8F2) are runtime effects from socket_back.",
